    "question": {
      ":question/id": "0f482c8a-e021-504b-b101-d2b82e668893",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are zero matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $U$ is *not* a zero matrix since one of its entries is not zero ($u_{12}=3\\ne 0$).\n\n- $L$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\n- $Z$ is *not* a zero matrix since one of its entries is not zero ($z_{13}=0.1\\ne 0$).\n\nTherefore, only $L$ is a zero matrix.",
