      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are zero matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $D$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, $d_{12}=1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $R$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, $r_{14}=10\\ne 0$).\n\n- $H$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ is a zero matrix.",
